OL,3,APrince George's artwork featured in
OL,4,ACountry Life magazine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drawing of a kingfisher by Prince
OL,7,FGeorge features as part of a special
OL,8,Fedition of Country Life magazine, guest
OL,9,Fedited by his father, the Prince of
OL,10,FWales.
OL,12,FThe 13-year-old drew the bird, which is
OL,13,Fperched on a branch, while at home in
OL,14,Fthe spring.
OL,16,FThe artwork is included as part of a
OL,17,Fwider 300-page special edition of the
OL,18,Fmagazine, in which the Princess of
OL,19,FWales has also given an interview
OL,20,Fdiscussing her recovery from cancer,
OL,21,Fsaying she was told there would be
OL,22,F"good days and bad days".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
