OL,3,APrince George's artwork featured in
OL,4,ACountry Life magazine
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs well as providing an insight into
OL,7,Fhis family life, Prince William uses
OL,8,Fthe magazine as an opportunity to shed
OL,9,Flight on the working conditions for
OL,10,Fservicewomen and feature his
OL,11,F"fanatical" support for Aston Villa.
